[{"id":"ara-40-81-0","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"i pokazuje vam","en":"and he/it shows you (all)"},{"bs":"pokazujemo","en":"we show"},{"bs":"pokazao vam je","en":"he/it showed you (all)"},{"bs":"da mu pokažemo","en":"so that we may show him"}],"ref":"40:81","answerWord":"وَيُرِيكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e9b15311e1b0e2839416.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He showeth you His tokens. Which, then, of the tokens of Allah do ye deny?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَيُرِيكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","فَأَىَّ","ءَايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","تُنكِرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-13-12-2","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazuje vam","en":"he/it shows you (all)"},{"bs":"pa mu je pokazao","en":"so he showed him"},{"bs":"i pokaži nam!","en":"and show us!"},{"bs":"pokazujemo","en":"we show"}],"ref":"13:12","answerWord":"يُرِيكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/b3a7afaf652ddc608599.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who showeth you the lightning, a fear and a hope, and raiseth the heavy clouds.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يُرِيكُمُ","ٱلْبَرْقَ","خَوْفًا","وَطَمَعًا","وَيُنشِئُ","ٱلسَّحَابَ","ٱلثِّقَالَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-2-128-9","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"i pokaži nam!","en":"and show us!"},{"bs":"pokazat ćemo im","en":"we will show them"},{"bs":"da vam pokaže","en":"so that he/it may show you (all)"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"}],"ref":"2:128","answerWord":"وَأَرِنَا","answerSound":"audio/b3608c54bba54ef90283.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Our Lord! And make us submissive unto Thee and of our seed a nation submissive unto Thee, and show us our ways of worship, and relent toward us. Lo! Thou, only Thou, art the Relenting, the Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["رَبَّنَا","وَٱجْعَلْنَا","مُسْلِمَيْنِ","لَكَ","وَمِن","ذُرِّيَّتِنَآ","أُمَّةً","مُّسْلِمَةً","لَّكَ","وَأَرِنَا","مَنَاسِكَنَا","وَتُبْ","عَلَيْنَآ","إِنَّكَ","أَنتَ","ٱلتَّوَّابُ","ٱلرَّحِيمُ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-2-167-13","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazuje im","en":"he/it shows them"},{"bs":"da se pokazuju","en":"so that they may be shown"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pokazujem vam","en":"I show you (all)"}],"ref":"2:167","answerWord":"يُرِيهِمُ","answerSound":"audio/df00b73249a606e301e4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who were but followers will say: If a return were possible for us, we would disown them even as they have disowned us. Thus will Allah show them their own deeds as anguish for them, and they will not emerge from the Fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّبَعُوا۟","لَوْ","أَنَّ","لَنَا","كَرَّةً","فَنَتَبَرَّأَ","مِنْهُمْ","كَمَا","تَبَرَّءُوا۟","مِنَّا","كَذَٰلِكَ","يُرِيهِمُ","ٱللَّهُ","أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ","حَسَرَٰتٍ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَمَا","هُم","بِخَٰرِجِينَ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّارِ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-4-105-9","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazao ti je","en":"he/it showed you"},{"bs":"da ti pokažemo","en":"that We may show you"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pokažite mi!","en":"(you all) show me!"}],"ref":"4:105","answerWord":"أَرَىٰكَ","answerSound":"audio/fb1fd085a4cb7ae7680a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We reveal unto thee the Scripture with the truth, that thou mayst judge between mankind by that which Allah showeth thee. And be not thou a pleader for the treacherous;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["إِنَّآ","أَنزَلْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","لِتَحْكُمَ","بَيْنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","بِمَآ","أَرَىٰكَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَا","تَكُن","لِّلْخَآئِنِينَ","خَصِيمًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-6-75-1","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazujemo","en":"we show"},{"bs":"pa mu je pokazao","en":"so he showed him"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pokazujemo ti","en":"we show you"}],"ref":"6:75","answerWord":"نُرِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/93a61af19e42950ddafb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus did We show Abraham the kingdom of the heavens and the earth that he might be of those possessing certainty:","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نُرِىٓ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","مَلَكُوتَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلِيَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُوقِنِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-8-43-7","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazao ti ih je","en":"he/it showed them to you"},{"bs":"pokazujemo","en":"we show"},{"bs":"pokazao vam je","en":"he/it showed you (all)"},{"bs":"pokazao ti je","en":"he/it showed you"}],"ref":"8:43","answerWord":"أَرَىٰكَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/0367f9423a5b10bd4cff.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When Allah showed them unto thee (O Muhammad) in thy dream as few in number, and if He had shown them to thee as many, ye (Muslims) would have faltered and would have quarrelled over the affair. But Allah saved (you). Lo! He knoweth what is in the breasts (of men).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["إِذْ","يُرِيكَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","فِى","مَنَامِكَ","قَلِيلًا","وَلَوْ","أَرَىٰكَهُمْ","كَثِيرًا","لَّفَشِلْتُمْ","وَلَتَنَٰزَعْتُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَمْرِ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَلَّمَ","إِنَّهُۥ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِذَاتِ","ٱلصُّدُورِ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-17-1-14","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"da mu pokažemo","en":"so that we may show him"},{"bs":"pa mu je pokazao","en":"so he showed him"},{"bs":"i pokazujemo","en":"and we show"},{"bs":"da se pokazuju","en":"so that they may be shown"}],"ref":"17:1","answerWord":"لِنُرِيَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/dee61cebc5bfa431557f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Glorified be He Who carried His servant by night from the Inviolable Place of Worship to the Far distant place of worship the neighbourhood whereof We have blessed, that We might show him of Our tokens! Lo! He, only He, is the Hearer, the Seer.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["سُبْحَٰنَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَسْرَىٰ","بِعَبْدِهِۦ","لَيْلًا","مِّنَ","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","إِلَى","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْأَقْصَا","ٱلَّذِى","بَٰرَكْنَا","حَوْلَهُۥ","لِنُرِيَهُۥ","مِنْ","ءَايَٰتِنَآ","إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْبَصِيرُ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-17-60-11","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazali smo ti","en":"we showed you"},{"bs":"pa mu je pokazao","en":"so he showed him"},{"bs":"pokazat ćemo im","en":"we will show them"},{"bs":"i pokazujemo","en":"and we show"}],"ref":"17:60","answerWord":"أَرَيْنَٰكَ","answerSound":"audio/dd4077441e36a4e10577.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (it was a warning) when we told thee: Lo! thy Lord encompasseth mankind, and We appointed the sight which We showed thee as an ordeal for mankind, and (likewise) the Accursed Tree in the Qur'an. We warn them, but it increaseth them in naught save gross impiety.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","لَكَ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","أَحَاطَ","بِٱلنَّاسِ","وَمَا","جَعَلْنَا","ٱلرُّءْيَا","ٱلَّتِىٓ","أَرَيْنَٰكَ","إِلَّا","فِتْنَةً","لِّلنَّاسِ","وَٱلشَّجَرَةَ","ٱلْمَلْعُونَةَ","فِى","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","وَنُخَوِّفُهُمْ","فَمَا","يَزِيدُهُمْ","إِلَّا","طُغْيَٰنًا","كَبِيرًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-20-23-0","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"da ti pokažemo","en":"that We may show you"},{"bs":"pokazujemo","en":"we show"},{"bs":"i pokaži nam!","en":"and show us!"},{"bs":"pokazao vam je","en":"he/it showed you (all)"}],"ref":"20:23","answerWord":"لِنُرِيَكَ","answerSound":"audio/fba82da81ed0785c799d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That We may show thee (some) of Our greater portents,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["لِنُرِيَكَ","مِنْ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","ٱلْكُبْرَى"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-20-56-1","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazali smo mu","en":"We showed him"},{"bs":"i pokaži nam!","en":"and show us!"},{"bs":"pa mu je pokazao","en":"so he showed him"},{"bs":"da vam pokaže","en":"so that he/it may show you (all)"}],"ref":"20:56","answerWord":"أَرَيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/5f318feedb318535e819.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We verily did show him all Our tokens, but he denied them and refused.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","أَرَيْنَٰهُ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","كُلَّهَا","فَكَذَّبَ","وَأَبَىٰ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-23-95-3","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazujemo ti","en":"we show you"},{"bs":"i pokazujemo","en":"and we show"},{"bs":"pokazao ti je","en":"he/it showed you"},{"bs":"pokazat ćemo im","en":"we will show them"}],"ref":"23:95","answerWord":"نُّرِيَكَ","answerSound":"audio/80b56950e19c5a1467ab.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily We are Able to show thee that which We have promised them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَإِنَّا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","نُّرِيَكَ","مَا","نَعِدُهُمْ","لَقَٰدِرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-27-93-3","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazat će vam","en":"he/it will show you (all)"},{"bs":"da mu pokažemo","en":"so that we may show him"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"i pokazujemo","en":"and we show"}],"ref":"27:93","answerWord":"سَيُرِيكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8e46dc3782f189af033e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And say: Praise be to Allah Who will show you His portents so that ye shall know them. And thy Lord is not unaware of what ye (mortals) do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَقُلِ","ٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","سَيُرِيكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","فَتَعْرِفُونَهَا","وَمَا","رَبُّكَ","بِغَٰفِلٍ","عَمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-28-6-4","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"i pokazujemo","en":"and we show"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pa mi pokažite!","en":"so (you all) show me!"},{"bs":"pokazuje im","en":"he/it shows them"}],"ref":"28:6","answerWord":"وَنُرِىَ","answerSound":"audio/7a2361cfed4bd01c95f1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And to establish them in the earth, and to show Pharaoh and Haman and their hosts that which they feared from them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَنُمَكِّنَ","لَهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَنُرِىَ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَهَٰمَٰنَ","وَجُنُودَهُمَا","مِنْهُم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَحْذَرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-31-11-3","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa mi pokažite!","en":"so (you all) show me!"},{"bs":"i pokaži nam!","en":"and show us!"},{"bs":"pokazuje im","en":"he/it shows them"},{"bs":"pokazao ti je","en":"he/it showed you"}],"ref":"31:11","answerWord":"فَأَرُونِى","answerSound":"audio/14008d02ed30c5ad4460.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"This is the Creation of Allah. Now show me that which those (ye worship) beside Him have created. Nay, but the wrong-doers are in error manifest!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["هَٰذَا","خَلْقُ","ٱللَّهِ","فَأَرُونِى","مَاذَا","خَلَقَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","دُونِهِۦ","بَلِ","ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ","فِى","ضَلَٰلٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-31-31-9","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"da vam pokaže","en":"so that he/it may show you (all)"},{"bs":"pokažite mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pokazali smo mu","en":"We showed him"},{"bs":"i pokaži nam!","en":"and show us!"}],"ref":"31:31","answerWord":"لِيُرِيَكُم","answerSound":"audio/1832f048fd082ca078df.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hast thou not seen how the ships glide on the sea by Allah's grace, that He may show you of His wonders? Lo! therein indeed are portents for every steadfast, grateful (heart).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","أَنَّ","ٱلْفُلْكَ","تَجْرِى","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","بِنِعْمَتِ","ٱللَّهِ","لِيُرِيَكُم","مِّنْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّكُلِّ","صَبَّارٍ","شَكُورٍ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-34-27-1","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokažite mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pokazujemo","en":"we show"},{"bs":"pokazuje vam","en":"he/it shows you (all)"},{"bs":"pokazujemo ti","en":"we show you"}],"ref":"34:27","answerWord":"أَرُونِىَ","answerSound":"audio/831e21a764bb6d6162c5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Show me those whom ye have joined unto Him as partners. Nay (ye dare not)! For He is Allah, the Mighty, the Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَرُونِىَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَلْحَقْتُم","بِهِۦ","شُرَكَآءَ","كَلَّا","بَلْ","هُوَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلْعَزِيزُ","ٱلْحَكِيمُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-40-13-2","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazuje vam","en":"he/it shows you (all)"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"da ti pokažemo","en":"that We may show you"},{"bs":"pokazali smo ti","en":"we showed you"}],"ref":"40:13","answerWord":"يُرِيكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ae93600616de219e7e80.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who showeth you His portents, and sendeth down for you provision from the sky. None payeth heed save him who turneth (unto Him) repentant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يُرِيكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","وَيُنَزِّلُ","لَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","رِزْقًا","وَمَا","يَتَذَكَّرُ","إِلَّا","مَن","يُنِيبُ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-41-53-0","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazat ćemo im","en":"we will show them"},{"bs":"pokazuje vam","en":"he/it shows you (all)"},{"bs":"pokaži mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"pokazujem vam","en":"I show you (all)"}],"ref":"41:53","answerWord":"سَنُرِيهِمْ","answerSound":"audio/a8ffe6d38110513d86cc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We shall show them Our portents on the horizons and within themselves until it will be manifest unto them that it is the Truth. Doth not thy Lord suffice, since He is Witness over all things?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["سَنُرِيهِمْ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","فِى","ٱلْءَافَاقِ","وَفِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","حَتَّىٰ","يَتَبَيَّنَ","لَهُمْ","أَنَّهُ","ٱلْحَقُّ","أَوَلَمْ","يَكْفِ","بِرَبِّكَ","أَنَّهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","شَهِيدٌ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"ara-43-48-1","words":["verb:ara"],"options":[{"bs":"pokazujemo im","en":"we show them"},{"bs":"pokažite mi!","en":"show me!"},{"bs":"da mu pokažemo","en":"so that we may show him"},{"bs":"da ti pokažemo","en":"that We may show you"}],"ref":"43:48","answerWord":"نُرِيهِم","answerSound":"audio/fe52b2dd2d140f2087f2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And every token that We showed them was greater than its sister (token), and We grasped them with the torment, that haply they might turn again.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati","en":"to show"},"passage":["وَمَا","نُرِيهِم","مِّنْ","ءَايَةٍ","إِلَّا","هِىَ","أَكْبَرُ","مِنْ","أُخْتِهَا","وَأَخَذْنَٰهُم","بِٱلْعَذَابِ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَرْجِعُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَرَى"}},{"id":"istataa-26-211-4","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogu","en":"they are able"},{"bs":"mogao si","en":"you were able"},{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"},{"bs":"mogao sam","en":"I was able"}],"ref":"26:211","answerWord":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/181a9605117053d16198.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is not meet for them, nor is it in their power,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["وَمَا","يَنۢبَغِى","لَهُمْ","وَمَا","يَسْتَطِيعُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-51-45-1","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"},{"bs":"mogao sam","en":"I was able"},{"bs":"može","en":"he/it is able"},{"bs":"mogu","en":"they are able"}],"ref":"51:45","answerWord":"ٱسْتَطَٰعُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/79ec3dea193a30461c99.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they were unable to rise up, nor could they help themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["فَمَا","ٱسْتَطَٰعُوا۟","مِن","قِيَامٍ","وَمَا","كَانُوا۟","مُنتَصِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-6-35-6","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogao si","en":"you were able"},{"bs":"možete","en":"you (all) are able"},{"bs":"može","en":"he/it is able"},{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"}],"ref":"6:35","answerWord":"ٱسْتَطَعْتَ","answerSound":"audio/68efd6deda5f5a42e5da.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if their aversion is grievous unto thee, then, if thou canst, seek a way down into the earth or a ladder unto the sky that thou mayst bring unto them a portent (to convince them all)! - If Allah willed, He could have brought them all together to the guidance - So be not thou among the foolish ones.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["وَإِن","كَانَ","كَبُرَ","عَلَيْكَ","إِعْرَاضُهُمْ","فَإِنِ","ٱسْتَطَعْتَ","أَن","تَبْتَغِىَ","نَفَقًا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","أَوْ","سُلَّمًا","فِى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","فَتَأْتِيَهُم","بِـَٔايَةٍ","وَلَوْ","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","لَجَمَعَهُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْهُدَىٰ","فَلَا","تَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-55-33-4","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogli ste","en":"you (all) were able"},{"bs":"mogao sam","en":"I was able"},{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"},{"bs":"možete","en":"you (all) are able"}],"ref":"55:33","answerWord":"ٱسْتَطَعْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a8b678d702844838217f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O company of jinn and men, if ye have power to penetrate (all) regions of the heavens and the earth, then penetrate (them)! Ye will never penetrate them save with (Our) sanction.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["يَٰمَعْشَرَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","وَٱلْإِنسِ","إِنِ","ٱسْتَطَعْتُمْ","أَن","تَنفُذُوا۟","مِنْ","أَقْطَارِ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","فَٱنفُذُوا۟","لَا","تَنفُذُونَ","إِلَّا","بِسُلْطَٰنٍ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-3-97-15","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogao je","en":"he/it was able"},{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"},{"bs":"mogao sam","en":"I was able"},{"bs":"mogli ste","en":"you (all) were able"}],"ref":"3:97","answerWord":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","answerSound":"audio/7f1bfd50f4e9655a4340.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Wherein are plain memorials (of Allah's guidance); the place where Abraham stood up to pray; and whosoever entereth it is safe. And pilgrimage to the House is a duty unto Allah for mankind, for him who can find a way thither. As for him who disbelieveth, (let him know that) lo! Allah is Independent of (all) creatures.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["فِيهِ","ءَايَٰتٌۢ","بَيِّنَٰتٌ","مَّقَامُ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","وَمَن","دَخَلَهُۥ","كَانَ","ءَامِنًا","وَلِلَّهِ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","حِجُّ","ٱلْبَيْتِ","مَنِ","ٱسْتَطَاعَ","إِلَيْهِ","سَبِيلًا","وَمَن","كَفَرَ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَنِىٌّ","عَنِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-4-129-1","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"možete","en":"you (all) are able"},{"bs":"mogli ste","en":"you (all) were able"},{"bs":"mogao si","en":"you were able"},{"bs":"mogli smo","en":"we were able"}],"ref":"4:129","answerWord":"تَسْتَطِيعُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/aa67354a12d0fbdc982e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye will not be able to deal equally between (your) wives, however much ye wish (to do so). But turn not altogether away (from one), leaving her as in suspense. If ye do good and keep from evil, lo! Allah is ever Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["وَلَن","تَسْتَطِيعُوٓا۟","أَن","تَعْدِلُوا۟","بَيْنَ","ٱلنِّسَآءِ","وَلَوْ","حَرَصْتُمْ","فَلَا","تَمِيلُوا۟","كُلَّ","ٱلْمَيْلِ","فَتَذَرُوهَا","كَٱلْمُعَلَّقَةِ","وَإِن","تُصْلِحُوا۟","وَتَتَّقُوا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","غَفُورًا","رَّحِيمًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-9-42-14","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogli smo","en":"we were able"},{"bs":"mogli ste","en":"you (all) were able"},{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"},{"bs":"možete","en":"you (all) are able"}],"ref":"9:42","answerWord":"ٱسْتَطَعْنَا","answerSound":"audio/32eb5799d4443c8910ad.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Had it been a near adventure and an easy journey they had followed thee, but the distance seemed too far for them. Yet will they swear by Allah (saying): If we had been able we would surely have set out with you. They destroy their souls, and Allah knoweth that they verily are liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["لَوْ","كَانَ","عَرَضًا","قَرِيبًا","وَسَفَرًا","قَاصِدًا","لَّٱتَّبَعُوكَ","وَلَٰكِنۢ","بَعُدَتْ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلشُّقَّةُ","وَسَيَحْلِفُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","لَوِ","ٱسْتَطَعْنَا","لَخَرَجْنَا","مَعَكُمْ","يُهْلِكُونَ","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","إِنَّهُمْ","لَكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-18-97-1","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"mogli su","en":"they were able"},{"bs":"može","en":"he/it is able"},{"bs":"mogli ste","en":"you (all) were able"},{"bs":"mogli smo","en":"we were able"}],"ref":"18:97","answerWord":"ٱسْطَٰعُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/c2564be37e4f43aaf001.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (Gog and Magog) were not able to surmount, nor could they pierce (it).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["فَمَا","ٱسْطَٰعُوٓا۟","أَن","يَظْهَرُوهُ","وَمَا","ٱسْتَطَٰعُوا۟","لَهُۥ","نَقْبًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"istataa-25-19-5","words":["verb:istataa"],"options":[{"bs":"možete","en":"you (all) are able"},{"bs":"mogu","en":"they are able"},{"bs":"mogli ste","en":"you (all) were able"},{"bs":"može","en":"he/it is able"}],"ref":"25:19","answerWord":"تَسْتَطِيعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/3f1d8d385a5e46911beb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus they will give you the lie regarding what ye say, then ye can neither avert (the doom) nor obtain help. And whoso among you doeth wrong, We shall make him taste great torment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"moći, biti u stanju","en":"to be able"},"passage":["فَقَدْ","كَذَّبُوكُم","بِمَا","تَقُولُونَ","فَمَا","تَسْتَطِيعُونَ","صَرْفًا","وَلَا","نَصْرًا","وَمَن","يَظْلِم","مِّنكُمْ","نُذِقْهُ","عَذَابًا","كَبِيرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"اسْتَطاعَ"}},{"id":"farra-26-21-0","words":["verb:farra"],"options":[{"bs":"pa sam pobjegao","en":"so I fled"},{"bs":"pobjegli ste","en":"you (all) fled"},{"bs":"pobjeći će","en":"(he) will flee"},{"bs":"bježite","en":"you (all) flee"}],"ref":"26:21","answerWord":"فَفَرَرْتُ","answerSound":"audio/7a49018c086a50b1ef69.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then I fled from you when I feared you, and my Lord vouchsafed me a command and appointed me (of the number) of those sent (by Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobjeći, bježati","en":"to flee, to run away"},"passage":["فَفَرَرْتُ","مِنكُمْ","لَمَّا","خِفْتُكُمْ","فَوَهَبَ","لِى","رَبِّى","حُكْمًا","وَجَعَلَنِى","مِنَ","ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّ"}},{"id":"farra-33-16-5","words":["verb:farra"],"options":[{"bs":"pobjegli ste","en":"you (all) fled"},{"bs":"pa sam pobjegao","en":"so I fled"},{"bs":"pa bježite","en":"so flee (pl.)"},{"bs":"pobjegla je","en":"(it) fled"}],"ref":"33:16","answerWord":"فَرَرْتُم","answerSound":"audio/0170f794435bf124fad0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Flight will not avail you if ye flee from death or killing, and then ye dwell in comfort but a little while.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobjeći, bježati","en":"to flee, to run away"},"passage":["قُل","لَّن","يَنفَعَكُمُ","ٱلْفِرَارُ","إِن","فَرَرْتُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْمَوْتِ","أَوِ","ٱلْقَتْلِ","وَإِذًا","لَّا","تُمَتَّعُونَ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّ"}},{"id":"farra-51-50-0","words":["verb:farra"],"options":[{"bs":"pa bježite","en":"so flee (pl.)"},{"bs":"pobjegli ste","en":"you (all) fled"},{"bs":"bježite","en":"you (all) flee"},{"bs":"pobjegla je","en":"(it) fled"}],"ref":"51:50","answerWord":"فَفِرُّوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/04c64f9c2e0cb66192ff.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefor flee unto Allah; lo! I am a plain warner unto you from him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobjeći, bježati","en":"to flee, to run away"},"passage":["فَفِرُّوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","إِنِّى","لَكُم","مِّنْهُ","نَذِيرٌ","مُّبِينٌ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّ"}},{"id":"farra-62-8-4","words":["verb:farra"],"options":[{"bs":"bježite","en":"you (all) flee"},{"bs":"pobjegli ste","en":"you (all) fled"},{"bs":"pa sam pobjegao","en":"so I fled"},{"bs":"pobjeći će","en":"(he) will flee"}],"ref":"62:8","answerWord":"تَفِرُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/6ba795a765b48178837f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Lo! the death from which ye shrink will surely meet you, and afterward ye will be returned unto the Knower of the Invisible and the Visible, and He will tell you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobjeći, bježati","en":"to flee, to run away"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","ٱلَّذِى","تَفِرُّونَ","مِنْهُ","فَإِنَّهُۥ","مُلَٰقِيكُمْ","ثُمَّ","تُرَدُّونَ","إِلَىٰ","عَٰلِمِ","ٱلْغَيْبِ","وَٱلشَّهَٰدَةِ","فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّ"}},{"id":"farra-74-51-0","words":["verb:farra"],"options":[{"bs":"pobjegla je","en":"(it) fled"},{"bs":"pobjegli ste","en":"you (all) fled"},{"bs":"pa bježite","en":"so flee (pl.)"},{"bs":"pobjeći će","en":"(he) will flee"}],"ref":"74:51","answerWord":"فَرَّتْ","answerSound":"audio/7aff3f228172639b4fad.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Fleeing from a lion?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobjeći, bježati","en":"to flee, to run away"},"passage":["فَرَّتْ","مِن","قَسْوَرَةٍۭ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّ"}},{"id":"farra-80-34-1","words":["verb:farra"],"options":[{"bs":"pobjeći će","en":"(he) will flee"},{"bs":"pa sam pobjegao","en":"so I fled"},{"bs":"pobjegli ste","en":"you (all) fled"},{"bs":"pobjegla je","en":"(it) fled"}],"ref":"80:34","answerWord":"يَفِرُّ","answerSound":"audio/38fdeba2c508ce9f5059.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On the day when a man fleeth from his brother","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobjeći, bježati","en":"to flee, to run away"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","يَفِرُّ","ٱلْمَرْءُ","مِنْ","أَخِيهِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"فَرَّ"}}]